{"id": "N-04", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "bn", "story": "আমি আজমানে একটি দোকানে কাজ করতাম। ৩০ দিনের নোটিশ দিয়ে চাকরি ছেড়েছি, শেষ দিন ছিল ৩১ আগস্ট ২০২৬। আমি ২ সেপ্টেম্বর ২০২৫ থেকে কাজ শুরু করেছিলাম। আমি কি গ্র্যাচুইটি পাব?", "form": {"emirate": "ajman", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2025-09-02", "basic_wage_aed": "1600", "total_wage_aed": "2100", "end_date": "2026-08-31"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "resigned", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 30, "unused_leave_days": 0}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["gratuity"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art51:cl2"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art51", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art42", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art54"], "claim": {"End-of-service gratuity": "0.00"}, "total": "0.00"}, "notes": "364 days: one day short of a year, so gratuity is 0.00.", "tags": ["gratuity", "edge"]}
{"id": "N-05", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "tl", "story": "Pitong taon akong nagtrabaho bilang receptionist sa isang hotel sa Dubai. Nag-resign ako at nagbigay ng 30 araw na notice. Ang huling araw ko ay 31 Hulyo 2026. Hindi pa nila ibinibigay ang aking gratuity.", "form": {"emirate": "dubai", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2019-02-01", "basic_wage_aed": "3000", "total_wage_aed": "4200", "end_date": "2026-07-31"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "resigned", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 30, "unused_leave_days": 0}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["gratuity"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art51:cl2"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art51", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art42", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art54"], "claim": {"End-of-service gratuity": "18004.11"}, "total": "18004.11"}, "tags": ["gratuity"]}
{"id": "N-06", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "ne", "story": "म अबुधाबीमा एउटा निर्माण कम्पनीमा मजदुरको काम गर्छु। चार महिनादेखि मलाई तलब दिइएको छैन। म अझै त्यहीँ काम गरिरहेको छु।", "form": {"emirate": "abu_dhabi", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2024-08-01", "basic_wage_aed": "1100", "total_wage_aed": "1500"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "still_employed", "months_unpaid": 4}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["unpaid_wages"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art22:cl2", "cr1-2022:art16:cl1"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art22", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art54", "cr1-2022:art16"], "claim": {"Unpaid wages": "6000.00"}, "total": "6000.00"}, "tags": ["unpaid_wages"]}
{"id": "N-07", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "ar", "story": "عملت في شركة نقل في الشارقة منذ يناير 2021. في 20 أغسطس 2026 أنهت الشركة عقدي فوراً دون إنذار، مع أن العقد ينص على إنذار 30 يوماً. ولم أستلم راتب شهري يونيو ويوليو، ولا مكافأة نهاية الخدمة.", "form": {"emirate": "sharjah", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2021-01-10", "basic_wage_aed": "4000", "total_wage_aed": "6000", "end_date": "2026-08-20"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "employer", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 0, "months_unpaid": 2, "unused_leave_days": 0}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["termination", "notice_pay", "unpaid_wages", "gratuity"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art42:cl3", "fdl33-2021:art43:cl3", "fdl33-2021:art22:cl2", "cr1-2022:art16:cl1", "fdl33-2021:art51:cl2"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art42", "fdl33-2021:art44", "fdl33-2021:art47", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art43", "fdl33-2021:art22", "fdl33-2021:art51", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art54", "cr1-2022:art16", "fdl33-2021:art65"], "claim": {"Unpaid wages": "12000.00", "Notice pay": "6000.00", "End-of-service gratuity": "16454.79"}, "total": "34454.79"}, "tags": ["termination", "gratuity", "unpaid_wages", "mixed"]}
{"id": "N-08", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "en", "story": "I worked part-time as a shop assistant in Dubai, 24 hours a week, from September 2022. I resigned with 30 days' notice and my last day was 31 August 2026. They say part-time workers get no gratuity.", "form": {"emirate": "dubai", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2022-09-01", "basic_wage_aed": "2400", "total_wage_aed": "3000", "end_date": "2026-08-31"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "part_time", "weekly_hours": 24, "termination": "resigned", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 30, "unused_leave_days": 0}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["gratuity"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art51:cl2"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art51", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art42", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art54"], "claim": {"End-of-service gratuity": "3362.30"}, "total": "3362.30"}, "notes": "Part-time: full-time gratuity × 24 ÷ 48 (CR 1/2022 Art. 30(1), flag 4).", "tags": ["gratuity", "part_time", "edge"]}
{"id": "N-09", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "hi", "story": "मैंने 1 फरवरी 2024 से अजमान की एक कंपनी में काम किया। मुझे दूसरी नौकरी मिल गई, इसलिए मैंने सिर्फ 10 दिन के नोटिस पर इस्तीफा दे दिया, जबकि कॉन्ट्रैक्ट में 30 दिन लिखा था। मेरा आखिरी दिन 10 सितंबर 2026 था। मेरी ग्रेच्युटी कितनी बनती है?", "form": {"emirate": "ajman", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2024-02-01", "basic_wage_aed": "1500", "total_wage_aed": "2000", "end_date": "2026-09-10"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "resigned", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 10, "unused_leave_days": 0}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["gratuity"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art51:cl2"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art51", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art42", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art54", "fdl33-2021:art43"], "claim": {"End-of-service gratuity": "2741.51"}, "total": "2741.51", "worker_owes": {"Notice pay you may owe your employer": "1333.33"}}, "notes": "Resigned with 10 of 30 notice days: the worker may owe 20 days, shown separately (flag 2).", "tags": ["gratuity", "notice_owed", "edge"]}
{"id": "N-10", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "ur", "story": "میں دبئی میں ڈرائیور ہوں اور ابھی بھی کام کر رہا ہوں۔ پچھلے تین مہینوں سے کمپنی ہر مہینے میری تنخواہ سے 1200 درہم کاٹ رہی ہے اور کوئی وجہ نہیں بتاتی۔ میری کل تنخواہ 2000 درہم ہے۔", "form": {"emirate": "dubai", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2024-03-01", "basic_wage_aed": "1500", "total_wage_aed": "2000"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "still_employed", "deducted_amount_aed": "3600", "deducted_monthly_aed": "1200"}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["illegal_deduction"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art25:cl1"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art25", "fdl33-2021:art39", "fdl33-2021:art22", "fdl33-2021:art54"], "claim": {"Deductions from wages": "3600.00"}, "total": "3600.00"}, "notes": "1,200 of 2,000 a month is 60%: over the Art. 25(2) 50% limit, so a note is added.", "tags": ["deductions", "edge"]}
{"id": "N-11", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "ml", "story": "ഞാൻ ദുബായിൽ ഒരു കമ്പനിയിൽ 2023 ജൂലൈ മുതൽ ജോലി ചെയ്തു. കമ്പനി 30 ദിവസത്തെ നോട്ടീസ് തന്ന് 2026 സെപ്റ്റംബർ 1-ന് എന്നെ പിരിച്ചുവിട്ടു. എനിക്ക് 15 ദിവസത്തെ വാർഷിക അവധി ബാക്കിയുണ്ട്. ഗ്രാറ്റുവിറ്റിയും അവധിക്കാശും കിട്ടിയിട്ടില്ല.", "form": {"emirate": "dubai", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2023-07-01", "basic_wage_aed": "2100", "total_wage_aed": "3000", "end_date": "2026-09-01"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "employer", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 30, "unused_leave_days": 15}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["gratuity", "leave"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art51:cl2", "fdl33-2021:art29:cl1"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art51", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art42", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art29", "cr1-2022:art19", "fdl33-2021:art54"], "claim": {"End-of-service gratuity": "4667.75", "Unused annual leave": "1050.00"}, "total": "5717.75"}, "tags": ["gratuity", "leave", "mixed"]}
{"id": "N-12", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "bn", "story": "আমি ২০০১ সালের জুন থেকে আবুধাবির একটি কোম্পানিতে হিসাবরক্ষক হিসেবে কাজ করেছি। কোম্পানি ৩০ দিনের নোটিশ দিয়ে ৩১ আগস্ট ২০২৬ তারিখে আমাকে চাকরি থেকে বাদ দিয়েছে। আমার পঁচিশ বছরের গ্র্যাচুইটি এখনো দেয়নি।", "form": {"emirate": "abu_dhabi", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2001-06-01", "basic_wage_aed": "6000", "total_wage_aed": "9000", "end_date": "2026-08-31"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "employer", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 30, "unused_leave_days": 0}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["gratuity"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art51:cl2"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art51", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art42", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art54"], "claim": {"End-of-service gratuity": "142610.96"}, "total": "142610.96"}, "notes": "25 years: the 2-year cap applies.", "tags": ["gratuity", "cap", "edge"]}
