{"id": "N-18", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "ur", "story": "میں نے جون 2025 سے دبئی میں ایک کمپنی میں کام کیا۔ اس دوران میں 60 دن بغیر تنخواہ کی چھٹی پر رہا۔ کمپنی نے 30 دن کا نوٹس دے کر 31 اگست 2026 کو مجھے فارغ کر دیا۔ کیا مجھے گریچویٹی ملے گی؟", "form": {"emirate": "dubai", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2025-06-01", "basic_wage_aed": "2000", "total_wage_aed": "2600", "end_date": "2026-08-31"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "employer", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 30, "unpaid_absence_days": 60, "unused_leave_days": 0}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["gratuity"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art51:cl2"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art51", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art42", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art54"], "claim": {"End-of-service gratuity": "1522.74"}, "total": "1522.74"}, "notes": "457 days minus 60 unpaid absence = 397 days: still eligible (Art. 51(4)).", "tags": ["gratuity", "edge"]}
{"id": "N-19", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "ml", "story": "ഞാൻ ഷാർജയിൽ ഫ്ലെക്സിബിൾ കരാറിൽ 2023 ജനുവരി മുതൽ ജോലി ചെയ്തു. 30 ദിവസത്തെ നോട്ടീസ് നൽകി രാജിവെച്ചു, അവസാന ദിവസം 2026 ഓഗസ്റ്റ് 31. എന്റെ ഓഗസ്റ്റിലെ ശമ്പളം ഇതുവരെ കിട്ടിയിട്ടില്ല.", "form": {"emirate": "sharjah", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2023-01-01", "basic_wage_aed": "2000", "total_wage_aed": "2500", "end_date": "2026-08-31"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "flexible", "termination": "resigned", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 30, "months_unpaid": 1, "unused_leave_days": 0}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["unpaid_wages", "gratuity"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art22:cl2", "cr1-2022:art16:cl1", "fdl33-2021:art51:cl2"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art22", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art51", "fdl33-2021:art42", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art54", "cr1-2022:art16"], "claim": {"Unpaid wages": "2500.00", "End-of-service gratuity": null}, "total": "2500.00"}, "notes": "Flexible contract: gratuity not calculated (ask MOHRE).", "tags": ["unpaid_wages", "gratuity", "edge"]}
{"id": "N-20", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "bn", "story": "আমি ২০২২ সালের ফেব্রুয়ারি থেকে দুবাইয়ের একটি নির্মাণ কোম্পানিতে কাজ করেছি। ১২ সেপ্টেম্বর ২০২৬ তারিখে কোনো নোটিশ ছাড়াই আমাকে বাদ দেওয়া হয়েছে। আগস্ট মাসের বেতন পাইনি, আর ১০ দিনের বার্ষিক ছুটি বাকি আছে।", "form": {"emirate": "dubai", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2022-02-01", "basic_wage_aed": "1800", "total_wage_aed": "2400", "end_date": "2026-09-12"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "employer", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 0, "months_unpaid": 1, "unused_leave_days": 10}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["termination", "notice_pay", "unpaid_wages", "leave", "gratuity"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art42:cl3", "fdl33-2021:art43:cl3", "fdl33-2021:art22:cl2", "cr1-2022:art16:cl1", "fdl33-2021:art29:cl1", "fdl33-2021:art51:cl2"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art42", "fdl33-2021:art44", "fdl33-2021:art47", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art43", "fdl33-2021:art22", "fdl33-2021:art29", "cr1-2022:art19", "fdl33-2021:art51", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art54", "cr1-2022:art16", "fdl33-2021:art65"], "claim": {"Unpaid wages": "2400.00", "Notice pay": "2400.00", "End-of-service gratuity": "5816.71", "Unused annual leave": "600.00"}, "total": "11216.71"}, "tags": ["termination", "gratuity", "leave", "unpaid_wages", "mixed"]}
