{"id": "N-23", "source": "new (7.2)", "language": "ar", "story": "عملت محاسباً في شركة في دبي من 1 يناير 2021 حتى 30 ديسمبر 2025، ثم استقلت بعد إنذار مدته 30 يوماً. الشركة لم تدفع مكافأة نهاية الخدمة.", "form": {"emirate": "dubai", "zone": "mainland", "worker_type": "private_sector", "start_date": "2021-01-01", "basic_wage_aed": "3000", "total_wage_aed": "4000", "end_date": "2025-12-30"}, "confirm": {"contract_type": "full_time", "termination": "resigned", "notice_days_contract": 30, "notice_days_given": 30, "unused_leave_days": 0}, "expected": {"route": "ready", "issues": ["gratuity"], "key_clauses": ["fdl33-2021:art51:cl2"], "supporting_articles": ["fdl33-2021:art51", "fdl33-2021:art53", "fdl33-2021:art42", "cr1-2022:art30", "fdl33-2021:art54"], "claim": {"End-of-service gratuity": "10500.00"}, "total": "10500.00"}, "notes": "Exactly 5 × 365 = 1,825 days: 105 days' wage.", "tags": ["gratuity", "edge"]}
